{"c":[{"id":"5672e8d92ee69a50307052bb4e51117b8b5e5f4bca68181bebb78714bc7c4975","sum":"equal_grain_pair is fold-test only; 3.11 floor is right after import sys (#42). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"61fbb8f64668e9b17ced31ae970f6ec0243d8c957831ea7327bca1389c9e6fe6","sum":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; fold_request walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself; sys.version_info is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints the floor message instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174900Z-adbb0c6c6a991bca","text":"equal_grain_pair is a fold-test oracle only; the copied driver does not keep it. fold_request still walks adjacent same-grain ViewNodes itself.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174934Z-b3f3d92f255bc910","text":"summem checks sys.version_info immediately after import sys and before import tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer instead of ModuleNotFoundError.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f3b2086879920a2ae41118c93866581f48ad4193b14fd63236911f2101ff135","sum":"3.11 floor is import-time before tomllib (#42/#38). Root wake prints how_to_text under Usage; AGENTS.md is bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T175246Z-a3c8d06b34d1a7c4","text":"PR #42 feat/require-python closes #38: import-time 3.11 floor before tomllib; Python 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003315Z-1061fd623922ceb6","text":"Root wake prints how_to_text under == SumMem Usage ==; the AGENTS.md prefix is the bootstrap only (wake-if-needed, note, writer-only).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"dcff76f4cde304afbbad7ee166bc0b4b29bab7abe8bded3e6f7647d98de8885b","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. Onboarding is init: prints the bootstrap (prompt_text()), writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. A consumer upgrade is copying the script. Root-wake catalog tests slice that section.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"961801789374c2175c3449024d4fab62e04ebf2e22a4f4651bd527456bad1a3d","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. A consumer upgrade is copying the script; init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T003337Z-7415cd62d790d57b","text":"Skip a root wake when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable; do not skip on a remembered wake or the footer alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003343Z-32520d7e11eb7ac8","text":"A consumer upgrade is copying the script; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d0629b8c4f7d147aaabb8e74c1becbbbe8f9af17d5d6ebf5ec3656bde51f28fe","sum":"Onboarding is init (prompt_text()); root-wake catalog tests slice the catalog section.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T004057Z-33f2fad52281ba51","text":"Root-wake tests that pin catalog shape must slice the catalog section; Usage contains .summem/summem and wake --path.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T133725Z-1b75d9fa0073870a","text":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); there is no docs/agents-prompt.md copy.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
